url: "https://github.com/ShantiDraconis/The-Algebra-of-Ideterminate-I"
abstract: "A computational algebra system for the Bottleneck Constant (I = 0/0) and extended number system K_I, providing formal verification in Lean, Coq, Isabelle, and Agda, with Python computational implementations. The framework introduces novel approaches to division by zero, quantum computing error states, and indeterminate form resolution."
